        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An autoimmune disease of skin and connective tissue that is characterized by subepidermal blistering especially in the lower abdomen, groin, and flexor surfaces of the extremities, creating tense blisters that do not break easily.</obo:IAO_0000115>
